
=== 0. capabilities, as the runtime itself reports them ===
  statestore-memcached   ['TTL']
  statestore-redis       ['ETAG', 'TRANSACTIONAL', 'TTL', 'QUERY_API', 'KEYS_LIKE', 'ACTOR']
  actorRuntime           DISABLED

=== 1. single-key write - both stores do CRUD ===
  redis                                      -> 204 
  memcached                                  -> 204 

=== 2. multi-key transaction - one request, two stores ===
  redis                                      -> 204 
  memcached                                  -> 500 {"errorCode":"ERR_STATE_STORE_NOT_SUPPORTED","message":"state store statestore-memcached doesn't support transactions","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/googl

=== 3a. optimistic concurrency on redis (ETAG capable) ===
  redis: write v1                            -> 204 
  redis: Etag header on read                 -> 2
  redis: write, matching Etag + first-write  -> 204 
  redis: write, same Etag again (stale)      -> 409 {"errorCode":"ERR_STATE_SAVE","message":"failed saving state in state store statestore-redis: possible etag mismatch. error from state store: ERR user_script:14: fai
  redis: value after the stale write         -> 200 "v2"

=== 3b. the same requests on memcached (no ETAG capability) ===
  memcached: write v1                        -> 204 
  memcached: Etag header on read             -> <none>
  memcached: write, matching Etag + first-write -> 204 
  memcached: write, deliberately stale Etag  -> 204 
  memcached: value now                       -> 200 "v3"

=== 4. redis: what a 'first-write' request leaves behind ===
  write v1, no concurrency option            -> 204 
    hash fields:
      data	"v1"	version
      1		
  write v2, first-write + matching Etag      -> 204 
    hash fields after a SUCCESSFUL first-write:
      data	"v2"	version
      2	first-write	0
  now write v3 with NO Etag                  -> 500 {"errorCode":"ERR_STATE_SAVE","message":"failed saving state in state store statestore-redis: failed to set key demo||probe-marker: ERR user_script:14: failed to set
  and again, NO Etag                         -> 500 {"errorCode":"ERR_STATE_SAVE","message":"failed saving state in state store statestore-redis: failed to set key demo||probe-marker: ERR user_script:14: failed to set
  value is still (correctly) v2              -> 200 "v2"

